 "rows": {"1.20.1(1)": {"explanation": "The by-law is divided into chapters, sections, articles and clauses using a decimal numbering system. This is for reading the by-law and does not affect any lot.", "code_refs": "none"}, "1.20.1(2)": {"explanation": "Articles or clauses may be divided further into bracketed numbered regulations, then lettered, Roman-numeral and lower-case lettered divisions. This explains the numbering only.", "code_refs": "none"}, "1.20.1(3)": {"explanation": "Chapters, sections, articles and clauses are intentionally not numbered consecutively, to leave room for future regulations; the Table of Contents gives the intended order.", "code_refs": "none"}}}
